OL,3,GNEWSAOne lane of M2 remains closed
OL,4,Aafter fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorning rush-hour commuters have faced
OL,7,Ffurther disruption on Thursday as one
OL,8,Flane on part of the M2 remains closed
OL,9,Ffollowing a fatal car crash on Tuesday
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,12,FThe coastbound section of the road
OL,13,Fbetween Chatham and Sittingbourne
OL,14,Fremained closed while clear-up works
OL,15,Fcontinued following the incident at
OL,16,Fabout 21:00 GMT on 27 October, but one
OL,17,Flane has since reopened.
OL,19,FKent Police is continuing to appeal for
OL,20,Finformation after a man in his 50s died
OL,21,Fafter he was struck by several vehicles
OL,22,Fnear Medway Services.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
